WEBVTT

00:25.490 --> 00:29.240
Humanity was suddenly reminded that day...

00:35.250 --> 00:38.210
...of the terror of being at their mercy...

00:40.670 --> 00:45.590
...of the humiliation
of being trapped inside a cage...

01:03.860 --> 01:06.030
All soldiers, prepare for battle!

01:06.240 --> 01:07.700
We have one target!

01:07.900 --> 01:09.700
We will slay it and claim this spot

01:09.910 --> 01:12.200
as humanity's first stronghold
beyond the walls!

01:13.280 --> 01:14.370
Target approaching!

01:19.790 --> 01:21.630
Split into five groups just as we practiced!

01:22.710 --> 01:24.920
We'll act as the bait!

01:25.130 --> 01:27.760
All assault squads,
switch to omni-directional gear!

01:49.490 --> 01:51.610
Strike from all directions at once!

01:57.160 --> 01:59.410
Taste the power...

01:59.620 --> 02:01.170
...of humanity!

02:18.220 --> 02:23.060
Unknown are the names
of the flowers that have been trampled

02:23.270 --> 02:28.530
Birds have fallen to the earth
and long for the wind

02:28.730 --> 02:33.610
Prayers won't solve anything

02:33.820 --> 02:38.950
Only the will to fight
can change the here and now!

02:39.160 --> 02:44.250
O pigs who laugh at the resolve
to walk over corpses to move forward

02:44.460 --> 02:46.790
Livestock complacency? False prosperity?

02:47.000 --> 02:49.670
Give us the freedom of dying,
starving wolves!

02:49.880 --> 02:55.050
The humiliation of being caged
is what triggers us to fight back

02:55.260 --> 03:00.350
We hunters slaughter prey
beyond the castle walls,

03:00.560 --> 03:05.560
consumed with surging bloodlust,

03:05.770 --> 03:12.700
as our crimson bows and arrows
pierce scarlet holes into the twilight

03:34.986 --> 03:39.991
To You, in 2000 Years: The Fall of Shiganshina, Part 1

04:06.960 --> 04:09.790
Huh? Mikasa...

04:10.000 --> 04:12.670
We should be getting back.

04:12.880 --> 04:15.880
What are we doing here...?

04:16.090 --> 04:19.050
You were that deep asleep
that you're still only half-awake?

04:19.260 --> 04:20.430
No...

04:20.640 --> 04:25.480
It just feels like I had this
really long dream or something...

04:26.770 --> 04:28.520
What was it about?

04:28.730 --> 04:30.650
I can't remember...

04:34.530 --> 04:37.030
Eren. Why are you crying?

04:37.240 --> 04:38.410
Huh?

04:48.120 --> 04:49.250
Listen!

04:49.460 --> 04:52.590
It was by God's great wisdom
that the walls were built!

04:52.800 --> 04:56.090
The walls are His divine work!

04:56.300 --> 05:00.050
No one must be allowed to defile the walls!

05:03.140 --> 05:07.180
Don't you dare tell anyone I was crying.

05:07.390 --> 05:09.100
I won't.

05:09.310 --> 05:12.770
Still, crying for no real reason...

05:12.980 --> 05:15.070
You should have your dad give you a checkup.

05:15.280 --> 05:18.780
Don't be stupid! I can't tell him!

05:18.990 --> 05:20.820
What are you cryin' about, Eren?

05:22.950 --> 05:24.580
Mr. Hannes...

05:24.790 --> 05:27.040
Did Mikasa get on your case about somethin'?

05:27.250 --> 05:29.750
Huh?! What makes you think I was crying?!

05:29.960 --> 05:31.750
Whoa, you reek of alcohol!

05:32.710 --> 05:34.090
It's like, come on, y'know?

05:34.290 --> 05:35.550
Oh.

05:35.750 --> 05:37.300
You're drinking again...

05:37.510 --> 05:39.130
You guys wanna join in?

05:39.340 --> 05:41.760
Actually, uhh... Don't you have work?

05:41.970 --> 05:44.470
Yup! We're guardin' the gate today!

05:44.680 --> 05:49.810
We're stuck here all day,
so we end up getting hungry and thirsty.

05:50.020 --> 05:55.730
If some booze happens to get into our drinks,
so what? It's no big deal.

05:56.820 --> 05:59.610
What if something happens?!
Can you fight like that?!

06:00.820 --> 06:03.700
- Whadya mean, "If something happens"?
- You know what I mean!

06:03.910 --> 06:06.950
I'm talking about if
they break the walls and get into the city!

06:10.290 --> 06:11.920
Oww...

06:12.120 --> 06:15.380
Geez, Eren. Don't go yellin' like that.

06:16.710 --> 06:19.550
You've got spunk, doctor's son!

06:19.760 --> 06:23.840
If they do bust down the walls,
we'll take care of business, don't you worry.

06:24.050 --> 06:28.140
But that ain't happened once
in the last one hundred years.

06:28.350 --> 06:33.690
Still, my dad says there's nothing
more dangerous than being complacent like that!

06:33.900 --> 06:35.810
Dr. Jaeger, huh?

06:36.020 --> 06:37.480
Yeah, he's got a point.

06:37.690 --> 06:42.200
He once saved this town from an epidemic.

06:42.400 --> 06:44.740
I can't argue with him.

06:44.950 --> 06:47.830
Still, they're another story altogether.

06:49.330 --> 06:53.040
When you're a soldier, you get to see
those things roaming around outside

06:53.250 --> 06:55.790
while you're on
wall reinforcement duty and stuff.

06:56.000 --> 07:00.840
These walls are fifty meters tall, though.
I can't see 'em getting through.

07:01.050 --> 07:05.840
Then... you're not actually
prepared to fight them at all?!

07:06.050 --> 07:06.930
Nope!

07:07.140 --> 07:09.310
Wh-What?!

07:09.520 --> 07:12.060
Then drop the "Garrison Regiment" name

07:12.270 --> 07:14.060
for "Wall Construction Squad" instead!

07:14.270 --> 07:15.940
Not a bad idea!

07:17.270 --> 07:18.690
But you gotta understand, Eren.

07:18.900 --> 07:23.070
If a soldier's doing his job,
things have seriously gone to hell.

07:23.280 --> 07:27.740
It's better when everyone's
calling us useless freeloaders;

07:27.950 --> 07:30.200
it means peaceful times for us all.

07:32.830 --> 07:36.830
Sure, we can stay
inside the walls our entire lives

07:37.040 --> 07:39.800
and do nothing but eat and sleep!

07:40.000 --> 07:43.840
But... that basically...

07:44.050 --> 07:46.220
That basically makes us cattle!

07:49.510 --> 07:51.560
Man, you're one plucky kid, all right!

07:51.770 --> 07:55.190
For someone who's totally helpless!
Right, Hannes?!

07:55.390 --> 07:57.100
Huh? Y-Yeah.

07:58.730 --> 08:00.570
Hey! Eren!

08:01.860 --> 08:04.280
What a weirdo!

08:04.490 --> 08:08.740
Wait... Don't tell me
he wants to join the Scout Regiment?

08:17.920 --> 08:21.750
Eren. I'd forget about
the Scout Regiment if I were you.

08:21.960 --> 08:25.340
What?! You think the Scout Regiment
is a joke too?!

08:25.550 --> 08:28.050
It's not about what I think.

08:34.890 --> 08:37.230
The Scout Regiment is back!

08:37.440 --> 08:38.980
They're gonna open the front gate!

08:39.190 --> 08:41.900
Let's go see the heroes return, Mikasa!

08:42.110 --> 08:43.070
Ohm!

08:54.580 --> 08:56.710
Damn! I can't see!

09:25.480 --> 09:28.360
They're the only ones who made it back?

09:28.570 --> 09:31.030
Everyone else must've gotten eaten.

09:31.240 --> 09:34.370
This is what they get
for going outside the walls.

09:34.580 --> 09:36.910
Moses! Moses!

09:37.200 --> 09:38.660
Excuse me...

09:38.870 --> 09:41.380
I don't see my son Moses anywhere...

09:41.580 --> 09:43.590
Do you know where he is?

09:44.960 --> 09:47.130
This is Moses' mother.

09:47.340 --> 09:48.670
Go get it.

10:14.280 --> 10:17.490
It's all we could retrieve.

10:33.930 --> 10:35.890
But... my son...

10:36.100 --> 10:38.390
He was helpful, yes?

10:39.930 --> 10:43.150
Even if he didn't achieve direct greatness...

10:43.350 --> 10:48.730
...surely my son's death
helped humanity fight back, yes?!

10:55.160 --> 10:56.490
Of course...!

11:00.330 --> 11:02.210
No...

11:02.410 --> 11:05.750
On this latest scouting mission, we...

11:05.960 --> 11:07.090
No...

11:07.290 --> 11:10.920
Just like all the other missions...

11:11.130 --> 11:15.470
...we achieved nothing at all!

11:15.680 --> 11:18.010
My incompetence has done nothing

11:18.220 --> 11:20.890
but needlessly send soldiers to their deaths!

11:21.100 --> 11:27.730
We haven't found out anything about them!

11:33.650 --> 11:35.030
Talk about gruesome.

11:35.240 --> 11:37.030
You can say that again.

11:37.240 --> 11:41.500
Our taxes are basically going
to feeding and fattening those things up now.

11:44.870 --> 11:46.710
What the hell, you little punk?!

11:49.040 --> 11:51.670
H-Hey! What are you doing, Mikasa?!

11:51.880 --> 11:54.090
Hey! Get back here, you!

11:55.930 --> 11:58.760
Mikasa! Enough already!

12:04.020 --> 12:07.190
What's the big idea?!
Now the firewood's all over the place!

12:08.310 --> 12:09.860
Eren.

12:10.070 --> 12:13.530
Have you changed your mind
about joining the Scout Regiment?

12:21.660 --> 12:24.160
Help pick this up.

12:25.290 --> 12:27.290
It's not that bad of a mess.

12:44.310 --> 12:45.810
We're home.

12:47.230 --> 12:48.730
Welcome back.

12:51.730 --> 12:55.650
Wow, Eren! You actually worked hard!

12:55.860 --> 12:57.150
Yeah...

13:00.490 --> 13:01.740
What do you want?

13:01.950 --> 13:05.200
Your ear's red. That shows that you're lying.

13:05.410 --> 13:07.830
You had Mikasa help you, didn't you?

13:08.790 --> 13:11.670
Oh? You're leaving, Dad?

13:11.880 --> 13:12.710
Is it for work?

13:12.920 --> 13:15.420
Yes. Some checkups in the interior.

13:15.630 --> 13:17.340
It'll take a couple of days.

13:20.550 --> 13:24.220
Eren says he wants to join the Scout Regiment.

13:28.140 --> 13:30.020
M-Mikasa! I told you not to say anything!

13:30.230 --> 13:31.520
Eren!

13:31.730 --> 13:33.400
What are you thinking?!

13:33.610 --> 13:37.530
Do you have any idea how many people
have died outside the walls?!

13:37.740 --> 13:39.860
- Y-Yeah, I know!
- Then...!

13:40.070 --> 13:41.570
Eren.

13:42.700 --> 13:45.660
Why do you want to go out there?

13:46.950 --> 13:50.920
I want to know what the outside world is like!

13:51.120 --> 13:55.300
I don't want to live my entire life
in ignorance inside the walls!

13:55.500 --> 13:57.210
Plus...

13:57.420 --> 14:00.470
If no one else is willing to take their place,

14:00.680 --> 14:03.800
then the lives of all who've died
will be for nothing!

14:07.560 --> 14:09.020
I see.

14:10.690 --> 14:13.310
My boat's about to leave. I better get going.

14:13.520 --> 14:16.480
Hold on, dear! Talk some sense into Eren!

14:16.690 --> 14:17.780
Carla.

14:17.980 --> 14:23.370
Words can't hold back human curiosity.

14:23.570 --> 14:24.660
Eren.

14:25.990 --> 14:28.700
When I get back, I'll show you the basement

14:28.910 --> 14:31.410
that I've kept secret all this time.

14:31.620 --> 14:33.120
R-Really?!

14:36.960 --> 14:38.840
Take care!

14:41.090 --> 14:43.470
Just forget it.

14:43.680 --> 14:45.220
Joining the Scout Regiment is a stupid idea!

14:45.430 --> 14:47.390
Huh?! Stupid?!

14:47.600 --> 14:52.600
People who don't mind living like livestock
are the stupid ones, if you ask me!

14:52.810 --> 14:54.020
Eren!

14:57.110 --> 14:58.280
Mikasa.

14:58.480 --> 15:01.110
He gets himself into trouble so easily.

15:01.320 --> 15:04.030
If anything ever happens,
you need to be there for each other!

15:04.240 --> 15:05.530
Mm.

15:08.450 --> 15:11.000
What's the matter, heretic?!

15:11.200 --> 15:13.870
If you don't like it, let's see you hit back!

15:14.830 --> 15:16.500
Y-Yeah, right!

15:16.710 --> 15:18.840
That would be stooping to your level!

15:19.050 --> 15:20.090
Say what?!

15:20.300 --> 15:23.470
You know I'm right!

15:23.680 --> 15:26.970
That's why you have to resort to violence!
Because you can't argue back!

15:27.180 --> 15:30.390
Which means you
concede defeat to me, does it not?!

15:31.810 --> 15:34.060
Shut up, smart-ass!

15:34.270 --> 15:35.350
Stop that!

15:37.360 --> 15:38.650
It's Eren!

15:38.860 --> 15:41.740
- That Idiot's back for more?!
- Does he want his ass kicked?!

15:41.940 --> 15:43.570
We'll tear you a new one!

15:44.860 --> 15:47.070
M-Mikasa's with him!

15:47.280 --> 15:49.870
S-Screw this! Let's get outta here!

15:55.370 --> 15:58.000
One look at me and they ran off!

15:58.210 --> 16:00.750
No, it was Mikasa they saw...

16:00.960 --> 16:02.170
Oww!

16:02.380 --> 16:04.380
Hey! You Okay. Armin?!

16:08.600 --> 16:10.810
I can get up on my own...

16:11.010 --> 16:12.390
Oh.

16:15.350 --> 16:20.190
I said humanity needs to venture
into the outside world at some point...

16:20.400 --> 16:22.530
...and then they beat me up
and called me a heretic.

16:22.730 --> 16:24.030
Damn...

16:25.700 --> 16:29.490
Why does everyone look down on people
just for wanting to go outside?!

16:29.700 --> 16:32.540
Well, because we've had
a hundred years of peace

16:32.740 --> 16:34.950
by staying inside the walls.

16:35.160 --> 16:37.210
They're worried that going outside carelessly

16:37.420 --> 16:40.210
will invite them inside the walls.

16:40.420 --> 16:42.420
The royal government's policies have made

16:42.630 --> 16:46.420
having any interest
in the outside world a taboo.

16:46.630 --> 16:49.760
It's our lives! We can risk 'em if we want!

16:49.970 --> 16:51.510
Absolutely not.

16:53.390 --> 16:54.600
Forget about it.

16:54.810 --> 16:57.560
Which reminds me,
I can't believe you told my parents!

16:57.770 --> 16:58.560
Huh?

16:58.770 --> 17:00.270
I never agreed to help.

17:00.480 --> 17:02.270
So, what did they say?

17:02.480 --> 17:05.740
They're... less than pleased.

17:07.150 --> 17:08.490
It figures.

17:12.870 --> 17:15.160
Indeed, I think people are crazy

17:15.370 --> 17:19.460
if they think we'll be
safe inside these walls forever.

17:19.670 --> 17:20.830
Mommy!

17:23.290 --> 17:26.800
Just because the walls
haven't fallen for a hundred years

17:27.010 --> 17:29.720
doesn't guarantee that they won't fall today...

17:31.300 --> 17:33.050
And yet...

17:51.990 --> 17:53.450
Wh-What was that?!

17:53.660 --> 17:54.870
An explosion?!

17:55.830 --> 17:57.250
- That way!
- Did something fall?!

17:57.450 --> 17:59.710
I'm not really sure...

18:00.830 --> 18:02.420
Hey, Armin!

18:06.000 --> 18:09.840
What is it?! What do you see?!

18:19.430 --> 18:20.850
It can't be...!

18:21.060 --> 18:25.610
Th-That wall... is fifty meters high!

18:26.520 --> 18:28.530
It's one of them...

18:33.950 --> 18:35.330
A Titan!

19:20.910 --> 19:25.790
L-it... opened a hole in the wall...

19:30.840 --> 19:32.010
They're inside!

19:32.220 --> 19:34.680
The Titans have gotten inside!

19:38.260 --> 19:40.010
We need to run too!

19:40.220 --> 19:41.100
Eren!

19:41.310 --> 19:43.180
My house is in that direction!

19:43.390 --> 19:44.440
Mom...!

19:45.650 --> 19:46.690
Mikasa!

19:52.860 --> 19:55.110
It's all over...

19:55.320 --> 20:01.620
Countless Titans... are going to overrun the city!

20:07.380 --> 20:09.210
It couldn't have hit our home!

20:09.420 --> 20:12.710
Just around this corner...
our house is standing there, like always!

20:17.300 --> 20:18.600
Mom!

20:21.100 --> 20:22.350
Mom!

20:24.180 --> 20:26.560
- Eren!
- Mikasa! Grab that end!

20:26.770 --> 20:28.270
We gotta move this pillar!

20:47.170 --> 20:48.170
Hurry, Mikasa!

20:48.370 --> 20:50.130
I know!

20:50.340 --> 20:53.380
The Titans have gotten inside, haven't they?

20:53.590 --> 20:55.760
Eren! Take Mikasa and run away!

20:55.970 --> 20:57.130
Hurry!

20:57.340 --> 20:58.970
I want to!

20:59.180 --> 21:01.510
So hurry and get out of there!

21:01.720 --> 21:05.140
The debris has crushed my legs...

21:05.350 --> 21:08.980
Even if I could get out,
I wouldn't be able to run.

21:09.190 --> 21:09.980
You understand what that means.

21:10.190 --> 21:11.940
I'll carry you, then!

21:12.150 --> 21:15.280
Why don't you ever listen to your mother?!

21:15.490 --> 21:18.200
You can at least do this one last thing!

21:18.400 --> 21:19.570
Mikasa!

21:20.530 --> 21:22.080
No...

21:22.280 --> 21:23.910
No...!

21:24.120 --> 21:26.200
If you don't go, all three of us will...

21:28.120 --> 21:29.210
Hannes!

21:31.460 --> 21:33.460
Take the children and get out of here!

21:34.670 --> 21:37.420
Don't go underestimatin' me, Carla.

21:37.630 --> 21:41.890
I'm gonna slaughter these Titans
and save all three of ya!

21:42.100 --> 21:44.600
Wait! Don't fight them!

21:45.470 --> 21:47.850
Yeah, I could save those two for sure.

21:48.060 --> 21:49.310
But now...

21:49.520 --> 21:52.020
I'm finally going to repay the favor I owe!

22:08.500 --> 22:10.330
Hey! Mr. Hannes!

22:10.540 --> 22:12.460
What are you doing?!

22:13.460 --> 22:15.170
- Thank you...
- Hey!

22:15.380 --> 22:18.090
Mom's still...!

22:18.300 --> 22:21.050
Eren! Mikasa!

22:21.260 --> 22:23.640
You have to survive!

22:36.190 --> 22:38.190
Don't go...

22:48.410 --> 22:52.120
Stop!

23:25.410 --> 23:29.290
Humanity was suddenly reminded that day...

23:33.870 --> 23:37.000
...of the terror of being at their mercy...

23:39.170 --> 23:44.340
...of the humiliation
of being trapped inside a cage...

24:09.530 --> 24:14.250
Your dreams are where your heart is

24:14.460 --> 24:20.500
They're more fragile than life itself

24:20.710 --> 24:25.220
Over and over you cast them aside,
only to find more

24:25.420 --> 24:31.930
Now, rest in peace

24:32.140 --> 24:43.030
Pounding impulses defile the things we wish for

24:43.230 --> 24:53.540
and the more we forget
the more we remember again

24:53.740 --> 24:59.500
In this beautiful, cruel world

24:59.710 --> 25:04.800
all I can do is ask why we're still alive

25:05.010 --> 25:10.430
Oh, with our strength... and our weakness...

25:10.640 --> 25:15.980
what are we going to protect if there's no sense

25:16.180 --> 25:20.770
to anything anymore?

25:26.860 --> 25:28.950
Shiganshina falls.

25:29.160 --> 25:34.490
Prayers, screams, and death
are all that humanity is allowed.

25:34.700 --> 25:37.466
Amid this, Eren alone
swears revenge in his small heart.

25:37.466 --> 25:39.790
That Day: The Fall of Shiganshina, Part 2
Amid this, Eren alone
swears revenge in his small heart.

25:39.790 --> 25:39.930
That Day: The Fall of Shiganshina, Part 2
